    "data": "<p><span class=\"font-size-16\">Billboard JAPAN 自2022年12月7日起与 NICONICO 合作，推出“ニコニコ VOCALOID SONGS TOP20” （NICONICO VOCALOID歌曲TOP20）。本排行综合视频播放，弹幕，收藏，点赞，相关衍生作品（翻唱，翻跳，演奏等）数量、播放数、弹幕数、收藏数、点赞数等数据，与 Billboard JAPAN 自主开发的独立系数相乘，生成排名前20的榜单。</span></p><p><span class=\"font-size-16\">统计对象包括各种使用歌声合成软件/音声合成软件（VOCALOID、UTAU、CeVIO、歌うボイスロイド、NEUTRINO、SynthesizerV等）进行制作的原创作品。 </span></p><p><span class=\"color-blue-04 font-size-16\">本期统计时段为2024/02/19-2024/02/25，本期视频版可点下方链接查看。 </span></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/card/f2db316813bc6eff510d4dee88592db812446725.png\" width=\"1320\" height=\"188\" data-size=\"36114\" aid=\"1101176085\" class=\"video-card nomal\" type=\"nomal\"></figure><p><span class=\"color-blue-02 font-size-16\"></span><br></p><p><span class=\"color-default font-size-16\">上期（第64期）可点下方链接查看。 </span><span class=\"color-blue-02 font-size-16\"> </span></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/card/55ec740c1d6d9a58eadee18cd537fbda12446725.png\" width=\"1320\" height=\"188\" data-size=\"35378\" aid=\"1450873494\" class=\"video-card nomal\" type=\"nomal\"></figure><p><span class=\"color-default\"></span></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/card/b9fac541680aa8630960b5460ab6695a12446725.png\" width=\"1320\" height=\"224\" data-size=\"32218\" aid=\"31730393\" class=\"article-card\" type=\"normal\"></figure><p><span class=\"color-default\"></span><br></p><p><br></p><p><span class=\"font-size-20\">第20位  <span class=\"font-size-20\"></span>ナ2モノ<span class=\"font-size-20\"></span>/Shu</span></p><p><span class=\"font-size-16\">上周： —<span class=\"color-blue-04\">（NEW!）</span>     在榜周数：1</span> </p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/card/dba39e36ef5b19d05dc501abc0b3973b12446725.png\" width=\"1320\" height=\"188\" data-size=\"41350\" aid=\"1500925474\" c